  "_sDescription": "Faithful Rework of the classic Half-Life MP5",
  "_bGenerateTableOfContents": false,
  "_sText": "Ever since the introduction of Half-Life, the MP5 is simply the go-to primary weapon. From single player campaign to multiplayer. You certainly do spend more time with the MP5.<br><br>With the introduction of the Half-Life High-Definition model, the Assault rifle becomes the M4/16.<br><br>However, not all maybe happy with the change from MP5 to M4/16. Thus, revert back to the old MP5. Sure enough, there could be players triggered by the low-poly MP5.<br><br>Ladies and gentlemen, I decide to present to you, a high poly version of the MP5, while retaining its texture (though been merged into one).<br><br>There are two parts reused in the MP5 model, but I thought that they should just be like that. The hands are the low-def version, instead of high-definition.<br><br>This is just one part of the model, I will introduce the player and world model later on.<br>",
